*   Description   : Installs the controlled Equipment UI phase-twenty-two  *
*                   for the 2025-07-16 client. It draws General/Costume    *
*                   assets, routes the renewal rail through the native     *
*                   mode event, and docks the native Swap child over       *
*                   bg_swap.png while preserving native item and packet    *
*                   ownership.                                             *
